<title>LATVIA: TABLE - Latvian Jan-May trade deficit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Latvian Jan-May trade deficit rises.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia' trade deficit in January to May was 207.2 million lats versus 169.93 million lats for January to April, the statistics committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>LATVIAN TRADE BALANCE  Jan-May '97  Jan-April '97  Jan-May '96  Exports		    374.20	 293.91	   306.39</p>
<p> Imports		    581.41	 457.85	   493.02</p>
<p> Balance		    -207.21	-169.93	  -186.63</p>
<p>Major trade partners:</p>
<p>EXPORTS (pct of total exports vs same period last year)</p>
<p>Russia  19.9 (25.6)</p>
<p>    U.K.    16.4 (10.5)</p>
<p>Germany 13.4 (13.4)</p>
<p>IMPORTS (pct of total imports vs same period last year)</p>
<p>Russia  16.6 (20.2)</p>
<p>Germany 15.0 (13.7)</p>
<p>Finland  9.6  (9.4)</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
